(1.5 Metacognitive Calibration and Calibration Gaps) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -24 Td
(Metacognitive monitoring evaluates how accurately learners predict their own performance. A persistent divergence between subjective confidence ratings and objective correctness scores reveals systematic metacognitive bias that targeted practice can progressively realign.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(This paragraph expands upon the analytical implications for curricular design, emphasizing structured dialectical interrogation over superficial memorization.) Tj
