(1.6 Grounding and Evidence Provenance) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -24 Td
(Educational assertions should always be anchored directly in authoritative source texts. By coupling assessment claims to verifiable coordinates such as page numbers, paragraph indices, and exact sentence excerpts, learners develop habits of source-critical inquiry.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(This paragraph expands upon the analytical implications for curricular design, emphasizing structured dialectical interrogation over superficial memorization.) Tj
