(1.7 The Role of Immediate Source Verification) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -24 Td
(Providing immediate access to relevant source excerpts upon incorrect responses prevents the consolidation of erroneous beliefs. Immediate verification allows learners to reconcile their mental model with the textual evidence before moving on to subsequent concepts.) Tj
0 -20 Td
(This paragraph expands upon the analytical implications for curricular design, emphasizing structured dialectical interrogation over superficial memorization.) Tj
ET

